set_option autoImplicit false
-- LEAN-MODEL-WITNESS Describe the concrete interpretation of every carrier and predicate.
-- LEAN-NONCOLLAPSE Name the proved witnesses showing important predicates are nontrivial.
-- LEAN-MODELS List every Claim.lean axiom name, separated by spaces, exactly once.
-- LEAN-MODEL-THEOREM Name the conjunction of all model and non-collapse theorems.
-- Supply a concrete finite/one-point model in which every black-box axiom used by
-- Claim.lean is proved as a theorem. Include non-collapse witnesses showing that the
-- target predicate and important intermediate predicates are not definitionally True.
-- End with `#print axioms <the LEAN-MODEL-THEOREM name>`; it may depend only on the
-- campaign's whitelisted Lean core axioms.
